DATA
The license records in this repository's releases are derived from the U.S. Federal Communications Commission
Universal Licensing System (ULS) public database downloads. That data is public record published by the U.S.
Government. No copyright is claimed in it. Fields not needed for callsign lookup (including street address,
PO box and FRN) are omitted. The ZIP-to-grid table uses the U.S. Census Bureau 2024 Gazetteer ZCTA file (public domain).
This data is provided as-is, without warranty, and may be out of date. The FCC ULS is the authoritative source.

Removal requests: support@shiverlogic.com, subject "Callsign removal" (see README.md).

